0           ! fresh start=0 restart =1
0           ! iteration to start from (fresh start 0 otherwise different)
20000       ! Final time step
1000        ! Saving frequency
3           ! inflow condition (0=Taylor green, 1=read from fields, 2=fluid at rest, 3=ABC as in FluTAS)
0.0005      ! dt for the simulation
0.006       ! mu (viscosity)
1.000       ! density
1.0         ! f1 = B of ABC forcing (FluTAS abc_y)
1.0         ! f2 = C of ABC forcing (FluTAS abc_z)
1.0         ! f3 = A of ABC forcing (FluTAS abc_x)
2.0         ! Forced wavenumber (ABC forcing)
0.5         ! Initial drop radius for phase-field
0.01d0       ! Surface tension
1.0         ! Ratio eps/dx
